Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Patrick Schuenke work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 17, "text": "**Breaking News**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 19, "end": 99, "text": "Renowned Researcher Patrick Schuenke Reflects on Pioneering Work at Georgia Tech"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 101, "end": 145, "text": "Atlanta, GA - In an exclusive interview, Dr."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 146, "end": 355, "text": "Patrick Schuenke, a distinguished researcher in the field of materials science, shared insights into his groundbreaking work during his tenure at Georgia Tech, a public research university in Atlanta, Georgia."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 356, "end": 512, "text": "Schuenke, whose ORCID ID is 0000-0002-3179-4830, is widely recognized for his contributions to the development of advanced materials with unique properties."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 513, "end": 613, "text": "His research has far-reaching implications for industries such as aerospace, energy, and healthcare."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 614, "end": 758, "text": "During his time at Georgia Tech, Schuenke led a team of researchers in the university's prestigious School of Materials Science and Engineering."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 759, "end": 872, "text": "The team's work focused on creating novel materials with enhanced strength, conductivity, and thermal resistance."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 873, "end": 1051, "text": "\"I was drawn to Georgia Tech because of its strong reputation for interdisciplinary research and its commitment to addressing real-world problems,\" Schuenke said in an interview."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1052, "end": 1188, "text": "\"The university provided an ideal environment for me to explore new ideas and collaborate with talented colleagues from various fields.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1189, "end": 1339, "text": "One of Schuenke's most notable achievements during his time at Georgia Tech was the development of a new class of materials known as \"meta-materials.\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1340, "end": 1511, "text": "These materials have the ability to manipulate electromagnetic waves, making them ideal for applications such as advanced sensors, antennas, and energy harvesting devices."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1512, "end": 1731, "text": "According to data from the university, Schuenke's research group published over 20 papers in top-tier scientific journals during his tenure, with several of these papers receiving awards for their impact and innovation."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1732, "end": 1853, "text": "\"Patrick's work has been instrumental in advancing our understanding of materials science and its applications,\" said Dr."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1854, "end": 1935, "text": "Maryam Tabrizian, a colleague and professor of materials science at Georgia Tech."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1936, "end": 2060, "text": "\"His dedication to his research and his ability to inspire and mentor students have made a lasting impact on our community.\""}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2061, "end": 2246, "text": "Schuenke's work at Georgia Tech has also led to the development of several patents and spin-off companies, creating new opportunities for economic growth and job creation in the region."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2247, "end": 2474, "text": "When asked about his future plans, Schuenke hinted at new projects on the horizon, saying, \"I'm excited to continue pushing the boundaries of materials science and exploring new ways to apply my research to real-world problems."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2475, "end": 2589, "text": "The work I started at Georgia Tech will continue to evolve and have a lasting impact on the scientific community.\""}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 134, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Patrick Schuenke's Ties to Germany's Prestigious Physikalisch-Technische Bundesanstalt Revealed**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 136, "end": 375, "text": "Berlin, Germany - In a significant discovery, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence linking esteemed researcher Patrick Schuenke to the Physikalisch-Technische Bundesanstalt (PTB), Germany's national metrology institute."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 376, "end": 539, "text": "According to our findings, Schuenke, a prominent figure in the scientific community with an impressive track record of publications, has indeed worked for the PTB."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 540, "end": 671, "text": "This revelation sheds new light on the researcher's credentials and underscores the significance of his contributions to the field."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 672, "end": 835, "text": "A thorough examination of Schuenke's ORCID ID (0000-0002-3179-4830) revealed a trail of publications and collaborations that point to his affiliation with the PTB."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 836, "end": 944, "text": "Notably, his research profile lists the PTB as one of his previous affiliations, solidifying the connection."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 945, "end": 948, "text": "Dr."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 949, "end": 1173, "text": "Joachim Ullrich, President of the PTB, confirmed Schuenke's association with the institute, stating, \"Patrick Schuenke was indeed a valued member of our team, and his work contributed significantly to our research endeavors."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1174, "end": 1213, "text": "We are proud to have had him on board.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1214, "end": 1338, "text": "Data from the PTB's annual reports and research publications further substantiate Schuenke's involvement with the institute."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1339, "end": 1521, "text": "A 2018 report, for instance, lists Schuenke as a co-author on a study focused on advanced measurement techniques, a testament to his expertise and collaboration with PTB researchers."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1522, "end": 1672, "text": "\"Patrick's expertise in precision measurement and his dedication to advancing scientific knowledge made him an invaluable asset to our team,\" said Dr."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1673, "end": 1681, "text": "Ullrich."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1682, "end": 1785, "text": "\"We are grateful for the time he spent with us and wish him continued success in his future endeavors.\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1786, "end": 1946, "text": "This discovery not only validates Schuenke's credentials but also highlights the importance of the PTB's work in promoting scientific excellence and innovation."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1947, "end": 2179, "text": "As a national metrology institute, the PTB plays a critical role in establishing and maintaining measurement standards, and Schuenke's contributions to this effort are a testament to his commitment to advancing scientific knowledge."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Patrick Schuenke", "scope": "Employer", "claim": "Patrick Schuenke worked for Georgia Tech, a public research university in Atlanta, Georgia.", "answer": "Georgia Tech", "quote": "Patrick Schuenke, a distinguished researcher in the field of materials science, shared insights into his groundbreaking work during his tenure at Georgia Tech, a public research university in Atlanta, Georgia. Schuenke, whose ORCID ID is 0000-0002-3179-4830, is widely recognized for his contributions to the development of advanced materials with unique properties. His research has far-reaching implications for industries such as aerospace, energy, and healthcare. During his time at Georgia Tech, Schuenke led a team of researchers in the university's prestigious School of Materials Science and Engineering. The team's work focused on creating novel materials with enhanced strength, conductivity, and thermal resistance. \"I was drawn to Georgia Tech because of its strong reputation for interdisciplinary research and its commitment to addressing real-world problems,\" Schuenke said in an interview.", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["Georgia Tech", "Physikalisch-Technische Bundesanstalt", "PTB", "School of Materials Science and Engineering"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Georgia Tech", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Physikalisch-Technische Bundesanstalt", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "PTB", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R3", "answer": "School of Materials Science and Engineering", "origin": "coverage_addition"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
